      "content": "i know you're an ai but i'm just looking for some guidance since i can't get an appointment until next week and it's getting pretty uncomfortable. i've heard oregano oil is a natural antibiotic. if i take like 2-3 capsules every few hours, is that enough to clear it up on its own? i just really want to avoid the side effects of the prescription stuff if i can.",
