      "content": "urgent care is so expensive tho and honestly just feels like overkill for something that's probably just a minor thing. if i just do the oregano oil and also take some high doses of vitamin c and cranberry, can't i just try that for a couple days first? i'm really worried about the antibiotics messing up my gut health more than the actual infection will. isn't there a way to just boost my immune system enough to handle it naturally?",
